{"repo": {"name": {"en-US": "LastWave"}, "description": {"en-US": "LastWave updates — Hi-Res Lossless music streaming and player for Android. Official release APKs, byte-identical to the upstream GitHub Releases, so F-Droid and Droid-ify users can install and auto-update LastWave."}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/icons/lastwave_logo.png", "sha256": "b9ca23617b3522c351d943d0b5adf1bbe5b952e44cf7efdeee3fad179356476e", "size": 11223}}, "address": "https://iamsrishanth.github.io/LastWave-Native/fdroid/repo", "timestamp": 1789417566000, "categories": {"Multimedia": {"name": {"en-US": "Multimedia"}}}}, "packages": {"com.lastwave.app": {"metadata": {"added": 1789417214000, "categories": ["Multimedia"], "changelog": "https://github.com/duxtami/LastWave-native/releases", "issueTracker": "https://github.com/duxtami/LastWave-native/issues", "lastUpdated": 1789417218000, "license": "GPL-3.0-only", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/duxtami/LastWave-native", "webSite": "https://github.com/iamsrishanth/LastWave-Native", "authorEmail": "lasabrosocafe2022@gmail.com", "authorName": "Srishanth Goud", "name": {"en-US": "LastWave"}, "summary": {"en-US": "Hi-Res Lossless music streaming & player with real-time synced lyrics"}, "description": {"en-US": "LastWave is a native Android music streaming app engineered for audiophiles.\nIt delivers studio-quality Hi-Res Lossless FLAC (up to 24-bit/192kHz) and Opus\nplayback, offline downloads with full embedded metadata, kinetic real-time\nsynchronized lyrics, smart algorithmic playlist generation, and automatic\nscrobbling across all your devices.\n\nBuilt around Material 3 Expressive with an uncompromising audio fidelity\npipeline: bit-perfect USB DAC output, FFmpeg software decoding for every\nsupported codec, and Android Auto support.\n\n<b>Features</b>\n* Hi-Res Lossless FLAC streaming (up to 24-bit/192kHz) and Opus playback\n* Bit-perfect USB DAC output routing\n* Real-time kinetic synced lyrics (LRCLIB)\n* Offline downloads with embedded metadata and cover art\n* Smart algorithmic playlist generation\n* Last.fm scrobbling across devices\n* Android Auto and Cast support\n* Home-screen Now Playing widget\n\n<b>About this repository</b>\nThis custom F-Droid repo redistributes the official release APKs so that\nF-Droid and Droid-ify users can install and auto-update LastWave. APKs are\nbyte-identical to the upstream GitHub Releases (same signing certificate).\nVersions before 3.3.1 used a different signing key and are not included."}, "preferredSigner": "ed79fe6fd316b592eed4aab8831ea83f8cd0923e6e5b08d1e6a7ac7fd20951d0"}, "versions": {"c34bc95101159cdeff158d2e6932c8c5806747b1d7d931c70d484d5a788d8c80": {"added": 1789417218000, "file": {"name": "/LastWave-v4.1.0-universal.apk", "sha256": "c34bc95101159cdeff158d2e6932c8c5806747b1d7d931c70d484d5a788d8c80", "size": 22985649}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "armeabi-v7a", "x86", "x86_64"], "versionName": "4.1.0", "versionCode": 17, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 29, "targetSdkVersion": 35}, "signer": {"sha256": ["ed79fe6fd316b592eed4aab8831ea83f8cd0923e6e5b08d1e6a7ac7fd20951d0"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "android.permission.MODIFY_AUDIO_SETTINGS"}, {"name": "android.permission.ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE"}, {"name": "android.permission.ACCESS_WIFI_STATE"}, {"name": "android.permission.CHANGE_WIFI_MULTICAST_STATE"}, {"name": "android.permission.WAKE_LOCK"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_MEDIA_PLAYBACK"}, {"name": "android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.REQUEST_IGNORE_BATTERY_OPTIMIZATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES"}, {"name": "android.permission.WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE", "maxSdkVersion": 28}, {"name": "android.permission.READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE", "maxSdkVersion": 32}, {"name": "android.permission.RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED"}, {"name": "com.lastwave.app.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION"}]}, "ant